      "writtenOn": "2022-04-14T22:31:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These parameters are software only.  I\u0027d argue that given Zephyr application will require a fixed set of the eSPI messages.  Possibly only the ESPI_CHANNEL_FLASH is board dependent, but we don\u0027t support sharing the AP SPI flash with the EC on any designs.",
